  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      229.73,
      512.87,
      714.36
    ],
    "text": "For the sea areas extending from Trincomalee to Negombo via Kankasanthurai and Mannar, and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota. PLEASE BE PREPARED! The sea areas off the coasts extending from Trincomalee to Negombo via Kankasanthurai and Mannar, and from Galle to Pottuvil via Hambantota will be very rough at times with strong gusty winds up to (55-65) kmph. The sea areas off the coasts extending from Negombo to Galle via Beruwala will be rough at times with strong gusty winds up to (50-55) kmph. The wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 2.5) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Matara. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard.",
